Package: admincleanr
Type: Package
Title: Administrative Data Cleaning and Record Linkage Helpers
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Samuel", "Barans",
           email = "sam.a.barans@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Helpers for messy administrative extracts: fuzzy string scoring,
    ID hygiene, environment cleanup for large-session work in R, parquet/Excel I/O,
    quick exploratory plots, browser-based onboarding via admincleanr_training(),
    heuristic datetime guessing, and candidate-key overlap scoring. Functions
    previously in admincleanr_crunch and admincleanr_pipe are now included.
